<https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#measuredItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Polymorphic — links either a <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#Measurement> or <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#JointMeasurement> to the <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#BOQItem> it covers. Domain intentionally left unspecified (antipattern #8): declaring rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#Measurement> would cause RDFS inference to classify every <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#JointMeasurement> that carries this predicate as also a <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#Measurement>, tripping MeasurementShape." .
