<https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#Measurement> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing> .
<https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#rateFromAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "On a BOQ line: the analysis version whose rate was applied to it. No rdfs:domain." .
